@host = http://localhost:5062

### ORD-001 — restaurant not found (real service error)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test User",
  "mobileNumber": "0912345678",
  "restaurantId": 9999,
  "orderType": "Delivery",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### ORD-002 — menu item does not belong to restaurant 1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test User",
  "mobileNumber": "0912345678",
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "orderType": "Delivery",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": 3, "quantity": 1 }]
}

