### ORD-008 — invalid ETB amount (amount validation endpoint)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/validation/amount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountEtb": 480.505
}

### Exercise 6 — malicious client total is ignored; server calculates total
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test User",
  "mobileNumber": "0912345678",
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "orderType": "Delivery",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 }],
  "totalEtb": 1
}

### Exercise 7 — deliberate exception; expect 500, traceId, no stack trace
GET {{host}}/api/v1/test/throw
Accept: application/json

### Valid ETB amount test — expect 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/validation/amount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountEtb": 480.50
}
